+CORRECTION (Theorem 2 corollary, not the main theorem): the claim that the
+threshold is "omega(n/(log n)^{1/5-delta}) for every delta>0" is INVERTED.
+t/(n/log^{1/5-delta} n) = 1/((log n)^delta log log n) -> 0, so t =
